# Changelog maintenance

This repo keeps a local changelog at **`CHANGELOG.md`** (Keep a Changelog style).

When you complete work that users, testers, or agents would notice:

1. Add concise bullets under **`## [Unreleased]`** in the appropriate section (`Added`, `Changed`, `Fixed`, `Removed`, `Deprecated`).
2. Include CLI behaviour, error/JSON shape changes, install/skill/docs updates, and recipe/patch semantics — not internal refactors unless they affect usage.
3. Do **not** create a git commit for changelog-only updates unless the user asks; still update the file as part of the same task when shipping other changes.

On version release (when requested): move `[Unreleased]` to `## [X.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD` and open a fresh `[Unreleased]` section.
